Package: omicsfold
Type: Package
Title: Reproducible Binary Classification for Omics Research
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Shahroz", "Rahman", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "shahrozrahman.me@gmail.com")
Description: Provides fold-local preprocessing and group-aware binary
    classification through the 'OmicsFold' Python engine. Supports numeric,
    expression and count matrices, held-out predictions, reproducible split
    assignments and HTML reports. Requires Python with the 'omicsfold'
    package installed; source and installation instructions are available at
    <https://github.com/ShahrozRahman/OmicsFold>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: jsonlite, processx
SystemRequirements: Python (>= 3.10), omicsfold Python package (>= 0.1.0, < 0.2)
URL: https://github.com/ShahrozRahman/OmicsFold
BugReports: https://github.com/ShahrozRahman/OmicsFold/issues
